# Text files are checked out with LF on every platform. The vendored parser is hash-pinned and tests
# compare fixtures byte for byte; with Git's Windows default (core.autocrlf=true) a checkout got CRLF
# and the hash test failed on the Windows CI runner (Phase 10 review).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.npz binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
